<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1991" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έρος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>awn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυραμίνους ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					117
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴσδυσις οὐδ᾽ ἀθέρι</span>
			prob. l. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
				2
			</span></i> B, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				18.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				595b27
			</span></i>:—in pl., <i>chaff</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρὶς δείσης καὶ ἀθέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					988
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>barb</i> of a weapon, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				154
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>spine</i> or <i>prickle</i> of a fish, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.303d
			</span></i>.</div>
